> Label directions, norm-matched random directions and pixel-mean edits

These next three grids use the same first held-out source per digit and the same five scales.
A visually changing image is not a target-class success metric. No classifier, fidelity score or
human rating is supplied, so the figures support inspection of these particular edits only.

